      "question": "What mechanisms are used to ensure the effectiveness of governance-related audits and controls in the context?",
      "answer": "Group Internal Audit, Group auditor, automated monitoring measures, internal control system, manual plausibility checks, process-independent monitoring measures, random sample audits, risk-oriented audit approach, risk-oriented planned audits, special audits",
      "type": "Factoid",
