      "question": "Which corporate strategy and reporting elements are essential for freenet's ESG compliance and governance?",
      "answer": "Corporate governance and other disclosures, Corporate management, Corporate strategy and goals, Economic environment, Non-financial group statement, Overview of the course of business, Report on expected developments, Report on opportunities and risks",
      "type": "Factoid",
