      "question": "Which guidelines ensure ethical governance and compliance within TAG's operations?",
      "answer": "Business Principles, Compliance Policy, Data Protection Policy, Donations Policy, Fleet Policy, IT Policy, Policy on Capital Market Obligations, Whistleblowing Policy",
