      "question": "Which compliance risks and topics are addressed to align with industry-specific governance and ethical standards?",
      "answer": "anti-corruption, capital market compliance, competition and antitrust law, conflicts of interest, contract awards, financial reporting requirements, gifts and donations, industry-specific compliance risks",
