      "question": "Which activity categories were used to classify initiatives aimed at improving workplace sustainability and employee well-being?",
      "answer": "Culture and value workshops, Learning and development, Occupational health & safety, On-site communication, Onboarding, Other measures, Recognition, Social events, Value-specific measures, Workplace, conditions, processes",
      "type": "Factoid",
