      "question": "Which business areas of Deutsche Börse Group contribute to economic sustainability and operational efficiency?",
      "answer": "Investment Management Solutions, cash market activities, collateral and liquidity management, derivatives business, fund distribution services, market data business, securities settlement and custody",
      "type": "Factoid",
