      "question": "What elements of the company's compliance framework promote accountability and decentralized decision-making?",
      "answer": "Chief Compliance Officer, Compliance office, decentralized compliance structure, independent Compliance and Data Protection department, local contacts for compliance issues, providing technical advice, reporting directly to the Chief Executive Officer, training the local contacts",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
