      "question": "Which greenhouse gases regulated under the Kyoto Protocol are included in the calculation of CO<sub>2</sub> equivalents for ESG reporting?",
      "answer": "CH<sub>4</sub>, CO<sub>2</sub>, HFKW, N<sub>2</sub>O, NF<sub>3</sub>, PFC, SF<sub>6</sub>",
      "type": "Factoid",
