      "question": "Which UN Sustainable Development Goals are supported by Scout24's ESG initiatives?",
      "answer": "Affordable and Clean Energy (SDG 7), Climate Action (SDG 13), Gender Equality (SDG 5), Partnerships for the Goals (SDG 17), Quality Education (SDG 4), Reduced Inequalities (SDG 10), Sustainable Cities and Communities (SDG 11), UN's Sustainable Development Goals",
