      "question": "What categories of risks were identified in BayWa's operations and supply chains related to sustainability and human rights?",
      "answer": "biodiversity loss, changes in land use, climate change, environmental pollution, forced resettlement, greenhouse gas emissions, health risks for the population, human rights and environmental risks, land expropriation, poor workplace health and safety",
