      "question": "What ESG-related topics are assessed in the organization's supplier audits?",
      "answer": "employee rights, energy, environmental management system, health and safety, human rights, subcontracting, waste and environmental pollution",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:002513:qa_pairs_factoid:0002",
