      "question": "What key principles are outlined in the BayWa Group's Inclusion & Diversity Policy to foster a socially responsible workplace?",
      "answer": "DEI, Inclusion & Diversity Policy, arbitrary unequal treatment, bullying, discrimination, equal opportunities, harassment",
