      "question": "Which social topics are strategically prioritized by CA Immo in its ESG initiatives?",
      "answer": "Wellbeing, community impact, diversity, employee empowerment, health and safety, social aspects of a sustainable supply chain, urban neighborhood development",
      "type": "Factoid",
