      "question": "What measures does CA Immo implement to ensure workplace safety and compliance with ESG standards?",
      "answer": "Digital information and inspections, ergonomic working, fire protection, indoor climate factors, internally appointed safety officer, legally required occupational safety measures, lone working/working alone, regular rounds and inspections, workplace and home office instructions, workplace evaluation",
      "type": "Factoid",
