      "question": "Who are the individuals contributing to the governance structure of MTU through their roles in the Supervisory Board?",
      "answer": "Claudia Sowa-Frank, Daniele Frijia, Dr. Christine Bortenlänger, Dr. Joachim Rauhut, Dr. Jürgen M. Geißinger, Gordon Riske, Heike Madan, Josef Mailer",
