      "question": "Which ethical principles and commitments are outlined in CA Immo's Code of Ethics to ensure ESG compliance?",
      "answer": "Code of Conduct, Code of Ethics, Compliance with laws, adherence to the law, ban on corruption, employee rights, environmental standards, human rights, legal, ethical and moral principles, prohibition of discrimination, social responsibility, transparency, zero tolerance",
