      "question": "What sustainability priorities are identified as material SDG business themes by BayWa AG?",
      "answer": "Deforestation and forest degradation, Efficient energy supply from renewable energies, Food security through sustainable agriculture, Managing risks and opportunities due to climate change, Reducing energy consumption and greenhouse gas emissions, Resource efficiency of products and services, Sustainable procurement, material SDG business themes",
