      "question": "What are the key databases and emission factors used by the Group to ensure compliance with the GHG Protocol?",
      "answer": "DEFRA, Ecoinvent database, GLEC, German Federal Environment Agency, International Energy Agency, country grid mix factors, emission factors, local grid mix factors",
      "type": "Factoid",
