      "question": "What purchasing objectives align with ESG principles such as sustainability and social responsibility?",
      "answer": "identify alternative suppliers, improve supply costs, increase the quality of deliveries and services, promote sustainability, reduce risks in the supply chain, social responsibility in the supply chain",
      "type": "Factoid",
