      "question": "Who are the groups that may influence STRATEC's ESG performance or be impacted by its decisions?",
      "answer": "associations, business partners, customers, employees, lawmakers, lenders, local authorities/residents, rating agencies, research institutions, shareholders, suppliers, the media",
      "type": "Factoid",
