      "question": "Which stakeholders are considered material for governance and operational sustainability at MAX Automation SE?",
      "answer": "Authorities / Legislators, Customers of the portfolio companies, Employees, Financing partners (banks), Managing Directors, Portfolio companies, Shareholders / Investors, Supervisory Board, Suppliers to the portfolio companies",
