      "question": "What compliance challenges and safety measures are described in the context related to chemical product management?",
      "answer": "fine in Italy, hazard communication, labeling of our chemical products, non-compliance with regulations, potential health and safety impacts, safety data sheet",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:003923:qa_pairs_factoid:0003",
