      "question": "Which elements are covered in Vonovia's compliance report to support governance and ethical practices?",
      "answer": "compliance issues, compliance training, compliance-related questions and suspicions, corruption, data protection issues, misconduct, potential breaches",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:004067:qa_pairs_factoid:0015",
