      "question": "Which sustainability-related trends are driving Siltronic Group's focus on energy-efficient wafer production?",
      "answer": "electric mobility, electricity from solar and wind farms, energy efficiency of chips, energy efficiency of electronic devices, energy-efficient chips, energy-efficient end products, growing interest in energy-efficient products",
