      "question": "Which training programs at the SMA Group contribute to fostering professional development in industrial, technical, and commercial sectors?",
      "answer": "B.Sc. Business Informatics, B.Sc. Computer Science, cooperative vocational training, dual study program, internship on project work, mandatory internship, nine different training occupations, one-year technical college internship",
