      "question": "Where are Evonik's facilities or sites subject to emissions trading systems or carbon pricing mentioned in the context?",
      "answer": "Austria, Fujian, Germany, Gibbons, Maitland (Canada), Morrinsville (New Zealand), Nanping, Shanghai sites, Singapore, Ulsan (South Korea)",
      "type": "Factoid",
