      "question": "Which compliance topics are prioritized in the KION Group's ESG-aligned training programs?",
      "answer": "anti-corruption, anti-discrimination, anti-money laundering, antitrust law, conflicts of interest, cybersecurity, data protection, fraud, human rights, whistleblower protection",
      "type": "Factoid",
