      "question": "Which compliance frameworks and tools support the SMA Group's governance and risk management objectives?",
      "answer": "Compliance Charter, Group Compliance guideline, SMA Business Partner Code of Conduct, SMA Compliance Handbook, SMA Employee Code of Conduct, compliance checklist, rules of conduct",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:004257:qa_pairs_factoid:0007",
