      "question": "What regulatory and procedural safeguards has AMAG Austria Metall AG introduced to uphold data protection standards?",
      "answer": "data protection breaches, data subject rights, employee data protection, internal data protection regulations, rules of procedure, standard contractual clauses",
      "type": "Factoid",
