      "question": "What initiatives under European sustainability regulations must q.beyond align with to ensure compliance?",
      "answer": "CSDDD, CSRD, Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive, Directive on Corporate Sustainability Due Diligence, ESAP, EU Regulation Establishing a European Single Access Point, EU Taxonomy Regulation",
