      "question": "Which personal identity factors does the organization prioritize to ensure equitable opportunities and foster ESG-aligned inclusion?",
      "answer": "culture, disability status, ethnicity, faiths, gender identity, language, military service, mindset, nationality, political conviction, race, religion or creed, sexual orientation, socioeconomic and family status",
      "type": "Factoid",
