      "question": "Why is the phased integration of the Terminal & Infrastructure segment into the reporting framework significant for ESG compliance, and how does it align with the European Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive (CSRD)?",
      "answer": "The ongoing integration limits the scope of reporting to selected key figures for now, with plans for full integration in the next reporting year. This phased approach aligns with the European Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive (CSRD).",
