      "question": "Why is achieving an almost perfect match between cash spreads and corresponding investments essential for liquidity management, and how does this practice align with ESG principles of operational efficiency?",
      "answer": "Eurex Clearing AG achieves an almost perfect match between the maturities of cash spreads received from customers and its corresponding investments. This minimizes liquidity risk and ensures efficient cash flow management.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
