      "question": "Why is the statutory minimum quota introduced in the Act to Extend and Amend the Act on Equal Participation of Women and Men in Management Positions important for advancing ESG principles in corporate governance?",
      "answer": "The purpose of the statutory minimum quota is to ensure equal participation of women and men in management positions by requiring Executive Boards of listed companies with more than three members to include at least one woman and one man.",
