      "question": "Why is the integration of employees into AI and ML processes essential for advancing ESG objectives at Commerzbank Aktiengesellschaft, particularly in fostering social responsibility and minimizing risks?",
      "answer": "Integrating employees into AI and ML processes ensures their expertise is utilized in adapting to new workflows, allowing the bank to leverage technological benefits while minimizing risks of errors and misuse.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
