      "question": "Why were invitations, gifts, and apartment rentals the most common compliance inquiries reported by employees in Germany during the reporting year, and how do these issues reflect broader ESG governance challenges?",
      "answer": "The most common compliance inquiries in Germany involved invitations and gifts, the rental of apartments to employees or persons close to them, and the private commissioning of TAG contractors by employees.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:004954:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0001",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
