      "question": "Why does declining investment confidence in the German mechanical and plant engineering sector pose challenges to technotrans' ESG goals, particularly in maintaining economic stability and fostering innovation?",
      "answer": "Investment confidence is declining due to a tense economic and geopolitical environment, leading to falling order levels. For technotrans, this makes it harder to compensate for reduced demand, even with a past order backlog, potentially impacting revenue and profit.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:003867:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0004",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
