      "question": "Why were the ESG topics addressed in the wienerberger Sustainability Program 2023 considered material, and how did they support the company’s alignment with sustainability goals and the European Green Deal?",
      "answer": "The program addressed climate & energy, the circular economy, biodiversity & environment, employees, and business ethics & social impacts. These topics were identified as material in 2020 and were significant for aligning the company’s operations with sustainability goals and the European Green Deal.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:003053:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0003",
