      "question": "Why has the SBO Group deferred implementing due diligence under the European Corporate Sustainability Due Diligence Directive (CSDDD), and how might this impact its ESG compliance strategy in the future?",
      "answer": "The SBO Group has not carried out due diligence under the CSDDD because the directive has not yet entered into force.",
