      "question": "Why are the quarterly meetings chaired by the Labor Director critical for ensuring compliance with occupational health and safety standards, and how do they contribute to SMA Group's ESG governance framework?",
      "answer": "The quarterly meetings chaired by the Labor Director aim to ensure that occupational health and safety management remains a priority. These meetings involve key stakeholders, such as safety experts, the Works Council, safety officers, and occupational health physicians, fostering collaboration and oversight of safety practices.",
