      "question": "How do the General Engagement Terms for Wirtschaftsprüfer and Wirtschaftsprüfungsgesellschaften govern professional liability for Hapag-Lloyd AG, and why is the limitation of liability significant in the ESG context?",
      "answer": "The assignment for the supervisory board of Hapag-Lloyd AG and professional liability is governed by the General Engagement Terms for Wirtschaftsprüfer and Wirtschaftsprüfungsgesellschaften, as of January 1, 2017. A key provision includes the limitation of liability for negligence to EUR 4 million, as stipulated in No. 9 of these terms.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
