      "question": "How does the yearly global employee engagement survey contribute to fostering ESG principles, and why is it significant for promoting inclusivity and reducing environmental impacts such as commuting-related CO2 emissions?",
      "answer": "The yearly global employee engagement survey serves as the main feedback channel for all employees, providing comprehensive insights into engagement levels and areas for improvement across the organization.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
