      "question": "Why might the expiry of fixed-term employment contracts be significant for workforce planning within the POLYTEC GROUP, and how does this reflect ESG considerations like equitable labor practices and governance transparency?",
      "answer": "The expiry of fixed-term employment contracts indicates planned or contractual employee departures, contributing to the overall fluctuation rate and reflecting aspects of workforce planning and contract management.",
