      "question": "Why does the European Parliament's draft of the EU's Corporate Sustainability Due Diligence Directive (CSDDD) introduce greater challenges for companies compared to the EU Commission's original proposal?",
      "answer": "The draft adopted by the European Parliament on June 1, 2023, goes beyond the EU Commission's original proposal by introducing additional bureaucratic requirements and lacking clear legal limitations. These changes could impose greater challenges on companies, particularly SMEs.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "test:000335:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0008",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
