      "question": "How does the Austrian Code of Corporate Governance (\nÖCGK) ensure transparency and accountability in the relationship between the Managing Board and Supervisory Board, and why is this important for ESG compliance?",
      "answer": "The Austrian Code of Corporate Governance requires the Managing Board to regularly, comprehensively, and promptly inform the Supervisory Board about all company-relevant issues. This includes reporting at least once a year on measures taken to combat corruption, ensuring transparency and accountability.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:004898:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0003",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
