      "question": "Why have PORR's Scope 1 GHG emissions remained constant compared to the previous year, and what does this indicate about the technological and ESG challenges in transitioning to low-carbon alternatives?",
      "answer": "PORR's Scope 1 GHG emissions have remained relatively constant compared to the previous year. This stability is attributed to the lack of sufficient technologically viable alternatives to replace fossil fuels in the company's operations.",
