      "question": "Why is assessing participant satisfaction and recommendation rates critical for ensuring the UI-Campus platform aligns with United Internet's ESG commitments to quality governance and employee well-being?",
      "answer": "Assessing participant satisfaction and recommendation rates ensures continuous improvement of the courses offered. High scores in these categories indicate the quality and effectiveness of the training programs provided through the platform.",
