      "question": "Why were the themes of 'Women in management positions,' 'Deforestation and forest degradation,' and others added to BayWa's materiality analysis in 2021, and how do they reflect evolving ESG priorities?",
      "answer": "BayWa added the themes of 'Women in management positions,' 'Deforestation and forest degradation,' 'Sustainable buildings,' 'Sustainable water withdrawal,' and 'Recycling of materials' due to their increased relevance for the company.",
