      "question": "Why did the q.beyond Group extend its risk analysis in 2023 to address human rights and environmental risks, and how does this align with the obligations of the German Act on Corporate Due Diligence Obligations in Supply Chains (LkSG)?",
      "answer": "In 2023, the q.beyond Group extended its risk analysis to include human rights-related and environment-related risks in both its own business area and the supply chain, preparing to meet the obligations of the LkSG.",
