        "paragraph": "This guideline is part of the People Development Approach and provides an overview of how talent management processes operate to enable its employees to support the growth plans of Lenzing. It includes the definition of performance, the performance management process, Lenzing's corporate values and behaviors, how goals are defined and describes how to conduct performance and development talks.",
