      "question": "Why does the weighting of Scope 1 and Scope 2 emissions differ between market-based and location-based views, and what does this reveal about technotrans' approach to energy sourcing and emissions management?",
      "answer": "In the market-based view, Scope 1 emissions accounted for 77% of total emissions, while Scope 2 emissions made up 23%. In the location-based view, Scope 1 emissions were responsible for 54.1%, and Scope 2 emissions for 45.9%, reflecting the impact of Germany's electricity mix.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:005553:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0005",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
