      "question": "Why are upstream and downstream categories outside of 3.1, 3.2, 3.10, and 3.11 considered less significant in the company’s Scope 3 emissions profile, and how does this prioritization align with ESG strategies?",
      "answer": "The text implies that upstream and downstream categories outside of 3.1, 3.2, 3.10, and 3.11 are less significant, as they collectively contribute less than 10 percent of total Scope 3 emissions.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:004362:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0005",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
