      "answer": "There are no DBOs for Mr von Platen, Mr Fromme, Mr Arnold, and Ms Engenhardt-Gillé because their pension benefits are structured as defined contribution commitments, reinsured by life insurance policies, which do not create long-term liabilities for the company in the form of DBOs.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:002439:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0007",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
