      "question": "Why is precise planning and coordination essential for accident prevention at ANDRITZ, and how does this contribute to the company’s ESG-driven focus on employee well-being and operational sustainability?",
      "answer": "Precise planning and coordination are crucial for accident prevention because they ensure that work activities are well-organized and employees possess the necessary training, skills, and experience to perform their tasks safely.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
