      "question": "Why did increased solar radiation in southern Spain during spring 2023 lead to challenges for BayWa Group, and how does this underscore the importance of hybrid solar projects in ESG-aligned energy strategies?",
      "answer": "In spring 2023, southern Spain experienced increased solar radiation, which contributed to a significant fall in electricity prices due to the expansion of solar technology. This highlights the need for hybrid solar projects to stabilize production and revenue.",
