      "question": "Why does the Supervisory Board prioritize horizontal comparisons over vertical ones when reviewing remuneration, and how does this approach align with governance principles of role-specific accountability?",
      "answer": "Vertical comparisons are generally avoided due to the unique nature of the Supervisory Board's work, which differs from the roles of employees within Deutsche Börse AG or Deutsche Börse Group.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:005752:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0006",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
      "question_word_f1": 0.665,
