      "question": "Why does SMA Group link variable remuneration for management and professional career paths to both financial metrics and individual targets, and how does this align with ESG principles of accountability and performance-driven governance?",
      "answer": "Variable remuneration for these employees is linked to short-term targets, with half based on the SMA Group's EBIT and cash flow, and the other half tied to individual targets. Sales employees also receive variable target-based components starting from middle levels of the structure.",
