      "question": "How do the responsibilities of companies and specialist departments in managing security risks reflect ESG governance practices, and why is this decentralization important for effective risk management?",
      "answer": "Companies and specialist departments are responsible for addressing security risks related to information and data predominantly created, collected, used, or processed within their respective areas of responsibility.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
