      "question": "Why are the international values and principles emphasized in SMA Solar Technology AG's Business Partner Code of Conduct essential for advancing ESG objectives and fostering sustainable business practices?",
      "answer": "The Business Partner Code of Conduct emphasizes respect for human rights, fair labor practices, health protection, occupational safety, product quality, fair competition, confidentiality, protection of information and property, environmental protection, and responsible energy use.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
