      "question": "Why does the reporting year represent a significant milestone in Hapag-Lloyd's ESG-driven training initiatives, and how do these advancements support long-term employee development and organizational sustainability?",
      "answer": "The reporting year marks a milestone with the launch of the Hapag-Lloyd Academy's first courses and the development of web-based training programs, reflecting a significant advancement in the company's education and talent development efforts.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "ESG",
      "question_id": "train:004806:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0013",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
