      "question": "Why did the sharp rise in education and training hours for service providers in 2022 represent a significant step toward United Internet's ESG goals for workforce capacity building and customer care excellence?",
      "answer": "The sharp rise was due to extensive courses provided to new service provider staff, particularly in the Customer Care and Education Management areas.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
