      "question": "Which technical screening criteria address the management of species that are not native to the ecosystem?",
      "answer": "ballast water management systems, biofouling prevention plans, introduction of non-indigenous species through the biofouling of hulls, release of ballast water containing non-indigenous species",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
