        "paragraph": "Total operating expenses (OpEx) of EUR 4,703 thousand comprise all direct, non-capitalised costs related to research and development, building refurbishment, short-term leases, maintenance and repair as well as other direct expenses related to the daily maintenance of property, plant and equipment, in accordance with Annex 1 item 1.1.3.1. of Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2178. The share of taxonomy-eligible operating expenses in financial year 2023 is 5.7%. The non-taxonomy-eligible operating expenses have a share of 94.3%. Measured against total operating expenses of EUR 4,703 thousand, the share of taxonomy-aligned operating expenses is 1.2%. This mainly includes operating costs for leasing and operating the Group's electric vehicles. 100.0% of the taxonomy-compliant operating costs are attributable to the environmental objective of climate protection.",
