      "question": "Which European legal frameworks regulate the use of substances in the context of taxonomy compliance?",
      "answer": "Climate Delegated Act, Delegated Act on Climate, Regulation on the Registration, Evaluation, Authorization and Restriction of Chemicals, RoHS Directive, Stockholm Convention",
