      "question": "Which annexes and environmental objectives are analyzed for Taxonomy eligibility in the 2023 financial year?",
      "answer": "Annex I (Climate change mitigation), Annex I (Sustainable use and protection of water and marine resources), Annex II (Climate change adaptation), Annex II (Transition to a circular economy), Annex III (Pollution prevention and control), Annex IV (Protection and restoration of biodiversity and ecosystems)",
