      "question": "What components were analyzed by freenet AG to assess the impact of the EU Taxonomy on its business activities?",
      "answer": "Delegated Acts of 27 June 2023, EU Taxonomy, climate change adaptation, climate change mitigation, four new environmental objectives, impact matrix",
      "type": "Factoid",
