      "question": "What financial figures are analyzed for EU Taxonomy eligibility and alignment in the context?",
      "answer": "0 %, 9 %, EUR 144 thousand, EUR 2,472 thousand, EUR 211 thousand, EUR 4 thousand, EUR 64 thousand",
