      "question": "Which reporting standards are applied to determine taxonomy-aligned sales revenue in the Delegated Act on Reporting Obligations?",
      "answer": "Delegated Act on Reporting Obligations, IAS 1.82 (a), taxonomy-aligned economic activities",
