      "question": "What regulatory frameworks and sustainability standards are applied in Zalando's non-financial declaration under the EU Taxonomy?",
      "answer": "Article 8 of the EU Taxonomy Regulation, CSR Directive on Non-Financial Reporting, CSR-RUG, GRI Standards, Section 315b (1) and (3) HGB",
