      "question": "Which EU regulations and delegated acts were analyzed to identify economic activities eligible under the Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "2022/1214, 2023/2485, 2023/2486, 2023/3850, 2023/3851, Commission Delegated Regulations (EU) 2021/2139, Regulation (EU) 2020/852, Regulation (EU) 2021/2178",
      "type": "Factoid",
