      "question": "Which processes are used at Vienna Airport to ensure supplier compliance with procurement regulations and EU Taxonomy governance standards?",
      "answer": "Austrian Federal Public Procurement Act, Bundesvergabegesetz, authorisation, financial, economic and technical performance, invitations to tender, professional reliability, relevant platforms, suitability of suppliers",
