        "paragraph": "An economic activity is considered a \"Taxonomy-eligible economic activity\" if it is included in the delegated acts enacted according to Art. 10 (3), Art. 11 (3), Art. 12 (2), Art. 13 (2), Art. 14 (2) and Art. 15 (2) of the Taxonomy Regulation. This applies regardless of whether this economic activity meets all the technical screening criteria set out in these delegated acts (cf. Art. 1 No. 5 of Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2178 to Art. 8 of the Taxonomy Regulation (EU) 2020/852).\nAn economic activity is considered a \"Taxonomy-aligned economic activity\" if it meets the requirements set out in Art. 3 of the Taxonomy Regulation (cf. Art. 1 No. 2 of the Delegated Act to Art. 8 of the Taxonomy Regulation). This also includes compliance with the \"technical screening criteria\" set out in Art. 3 d).",
