      "question": "Which vehicle types and components are highlighted in the EU Taxonomy context for contributing to climate change mitigation?",
      "answer": "Passenger cars, all-electric vehicle motors, all-electric vehicles, light commercial vehicles, plug-in hybrids, powertrains to third parties, trucks and buses",
      "type": "Factoid",
