      "question": "Which environmental objectives are defined under the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "Biodiversity and Ecosystems (environmental objective 6), Circular Economy (environmental objective 4), Climate Change Adaptation (environmental objective 2), Climate Change Mitigation (environmental objective 1), Pollution Prevention and Control (environmental objective 5)",
