      "question": "Which EU regulations and delegated acts are evaluated for their role in Taxonomy-alignment and eligibility in the context?",
      "answer": "2023/2486, Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2139 Annex 1, Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2139 Annex 2, Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2022/1214, Regulation (EU) 2020/852",
