        "paragraph": "We evaluated actual and potential positive and negative impacts of our business on our area of activity (inside-out perspective) and the impact of external factors on our business activities (outside-in perspective). In addition, we addressed the following questions in the context of double materiality:\n $\\begin{array}{c} \\n\\bullet \\Rightarrow \\bullet \\quad \\bullet \\quad \\bullet \\quad \\bullet \\quad \\bullet \\quad \\bullet \\quad \\bullet \\quad \\bullet \\quad \\bullet \\quad \\$ \n- Impact materiality: How do our business activities impact the economy, the environment, and society (including human rights)?\n- Financial materiality: Do sustainability aspects represent opportunities or risks for our business activities in terms of cash flow and enterprise value?",
