      "question": "Which regulations define the classification system for environmentally sustainable economic activities in the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2139, Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2178, Delegated Regulation 2023/2485, Delegated Regulation 2023/2486, Regulation (EU) 2019/2088, Regulation (EU) 2020/852",
      "type": "Factoid",
