      "question": "Which financial indicators are required for reporting taxonomy-aligned activities under Article 8 of the EU Taxonomy Regulation?",
      "answer": "capital expenditure, financial key performance indicators, operating expenditure, turnover",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "test:000761:qa_pairs_factoid:0009",
