      "question": "Which internationally recognized frameworks are referenced in the Amadeus Fire Group's efforts to align with governance and compliance standards?",
      "answer": "DIN EN ISO/IEC 27001:2017, ISO 27001, ISO 27701, ISO/IEC 27001 standard",
