      "question": "What financial reporting components are linked to EU Taxonomy KPI calculations?",
      "answer": "Consolidated Financial Statements, Consolidated Income Statement, accounting standards, consolidated statement of income, framework of financial reporting, item [22], notes to the consolidated financial statements",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:005990:qa_pairs_factoid:0002",
