      "question": "Which components are identified as essential for battery manufacturing in the context of EU Taxonomy compliance?",
      "answer": "battery covers, battery holders, battery housings, manufacture of corresponding components for batteries",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
