      "question": "Which classifications are used to evaluate transactions under the EU Taxonomy framework based on eligibility and alignment criteria?",
      "answer": "Taxonomy Regulation, Taxonomy alignment, Taxonomy eligibility, Taxonomy-aligned, Taxonomy-eligible, Taxonomy-non-aligned, Taxonomy-non-eligible",
