      "question": "Which types of additions and investments are considered in the denominator for EU Taxonomy-aligned CapEx calculations?",
      "answer": "additions from business combinations (IFRS 3), additions to lease assets (IFRS 16), additions to long-term right-of-use assets (IFRS 16), gross additions to property, plant and equipment (IAS 16), total investments",
