      "question": "What specific categories of operating expenses are considered under EU Taxonomy criteria in the context?",
      "answer": "day-to-day servicing of property, plant and equipment, direct, non-capitalised research and development costs, maintenance and repair costs, non-capitalised lease expenses for short-term leases, operating expenses (OpEx)",
      "type": "Factoid",
