      "question": "Which operational expenditure components are considered immaterial to the Amadeus Fire Group's business model under the EU Taxonomy Regulation?",
      "answer": "OpEx KPI numerator, building renovation measures, day-to-day servicing of assets, maintenance and repair, operational expenditure, property, plant and equipment, research and development costs, short-term lease",
