      "question": "Why was transparency prioritized in the reporting approaches for revenues, CapEx, and OpEx, and how does this emphasis align with the EU Taxonomy’s principles of reliable and standardized disclosures?",
      "answer": "Transparency was emphasized to improve the clarity and reliability of data collection and reporting for revenues, CapEx, and OpEx, facilitated by automation steps.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
