      "question": "How does Annex II of Regulation (EU) 2021/2178 facilitate standardized reporting for taxonomy-eligible and taxonomy-aligned activities, and why is this standardization essential for comparability across organizations?",
      "answer": "Annex II of Regulation (EU) 2021/2178 provides the reporting forms that SGL Carbon uses to report the shares of taxonomy-eligible and taxonomy-aligned sales revenue, investments, and operating expenses.",
