      "question": "How does Zalando's reporting of capex related to the leasing of buildings demonstrate compliance with economic activity 7.7 under the Climate Delegated Act, and why is this activity significant for EU Taxonomy alignment?",
      "answer": "Zalando reports capex related to the leasing of buildings as Taxonomy-eligible economic activity because it aligns with economic activity 7.7 listed in Annex I of the Climate Delegated Act, which remains unchanged from prior assessments.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
