      "answer": "In 2023, €294.0 billion, or 91.2% of Group sales, was classified as taxonomy-eligible under economic activity 3.3. This included sales revenue from new and used vehicles, motorcycles, genuine parts, rental and lease business, interest income, and vehicle-related services such as workshops.",
