      "question": "Why is the table 'Development of intangible assets and property, plant and equipment 2023' critical for ensuring compliance with EU Taxonomy reporting requirements for eligible capital expenditures?",
      "answer": "The table provides detailed information on additions to intangible assets and property, plant, and equipment, serving as the basis for determining the denominator in the calculation of eligible capital expenditures.",
