      "question": "Why did BayWa Group experience contrasting changes in turnover from electricity generation using photovoltaic technology and wind power, and how do these shifts align with EU Taxonomy objectives?",
      "answer": "Turnover from electricity generation using photovoltaic technology decreased by €280.1 million, while turnover from wind power increased by €115.4 million. This reflects shifts in performance across different renewable energy sources within the Group.",
