      "question": "Why are transportation activities such as motorcycles, passenger cars, and light commercial vehicles considered taxonomy-compliant, and how does this compliance align with EU Taxonomy criteria for sustainable mobility?",
      "answer": "The transportation activities considered taxonomy-compliant include transportation by motorcycles, passenger cars, and light commercial vehicles.",
