      "question": "Why is the inclusion of technological and economic feasibility in the concept of 'suitable alternatives' critical for demonstrating compliance with Appendix C of the Climate Delegated Act for central inverters?",
      "answer": "The current stance is that the criteria in Appendix C of the Climate Delegated Act are considered met for central inverters by including technological and economic feasibility in the concept of 'suitable alternatives' and documenting the approach comprehensibly.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
