      "question": "Why are promotion opportunities during training programmes at the Amadeus Fire Group significant for fostering career progression and aligning with EU Taxonomy principles for social sustainability?",
      "answer": "Employees may be promoted to higher positions, such as team leader or manager, during the training programmes. Promotion depends on their performance and personal aspirations, aligning career growth with individual achievements and goals.",
