      "question": "Why are the DNSH criteria for activity 7.7 focused on climate risk and vulnerability assessments in 2023, and how do these assessments align with EU Taxonomy objectives for climate change mitigation?",
      "answer": "For climate change mitigation in activity 7.7 during 2023, the DNSH criteria are limited to conducting a robust climate risk and vulnerability assessment of material physical climate risks, as specified in Appendix A to Annex I of Regulation (EU) 2021/2139.",
