      "question": "Why does Delegated Regulation 2021/2178 require training costs to be included in both the numerator and denominator of the OpEx KPI calculation, and how does this align with EU Taxonomy objectives?",
      "answer": "Training costs are included in the numerator of the OpEx KPI calculation in accordance with Delegated Regulation 2021/2178, and these cost centres must also be included in the denominator.",
