      "question": "Why do POLYTEC's investments in energy monitoring systems meet the EU Taxonomy's requirements for taxonomy-aligned activities, particularly in the context of climate protection and environmental safeguards?",
      "answer": "Investments in energy monitoring systems are taxonomy-aligned because they contribute significantly to climate protection by improving energy efficiency. Additionally, they do not significantly impair other environmental objectives and meet the minimum protection requirements outlined in the Taxonomy Regulation.",
