      "question": "Why is it essential for non-financial undertakings to highlight the most relevant environmental objective in bold when reporting activities contributing to multiple objectives under the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "Non-financial undertakings must indicate the most relevant environmental objective in bold to ensure clarity and avoid double counting when computing contributions to multiple environmental objectives. This practice helps streamline reporting and ensures accurate alignment with the EU Taxonomy framework.",
