      "question": "Why is the measurement and reporting of capital expenditure from taxonomy-eligible outputs in category 'C' critical for compliance with EU Taxonomy requirements, and how does this align with sustainable economic activity reporting?",
      "answer": "Capital expenditure from taxonomy-eligible outputs in category 'C,' such as the acquisition and ownership of buildings (CCM 7.7.), is specifically measured and reported to align with taxonomy requirements and ensure accurate reporting of eligible activities.",
