      "question": "Why are certain technotrans products classified as taxonomy-eligible rather than taxonomy-conforming, and what does this distinction reveal about the challenges of meeting EU Taxonomy criteria?",
      "answer": "Some of technotrans' products are classified as taxonomy-eligible because compliance with the technical screening criteria could not be clearly verified. This classification reflects uncertainty in meeting the specific criteria outlined in the EU Taxonomy regulations.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
