        "paragraph": "Operating expenses essentially contain expenses in connection with the daily maintenance and repair of investment properties and tangible assets. The Taxonomy-aligned portion of EUR 9.0 million or 21.1% of total OpEx (previous year: EUR 7.5 million or 18.8% of total OpEx), relates to the maintenance and repair of buildings that were classified as Taxonomy-aligned in accordance with the requirements of activity 7.7 in the Company's review of the Taxonomy requirements. The Taxonomy-aligned portion essentially includes non-capitalised expenses in connection with the maintenance and repair of heating and ventilation systems, as well as work on the building and electrical systems, and carpentry and painting work, and is roughly on par with the previous year's level.",
