      "question": "How do the amendments to Appendix C in the Amended Climate Delegated Act (EU) 2023/2485 impact the DNSH criteria for activities like hydrogen equipment and battery manufacturing, and why are these activities still considered taxonomy-eligible?",
      "answer": "These activities are reported as taxonomy-eligible for 2023 because the amendments to Appendix C in the Amended Climate Delegated Act (EU) 2023/2485 resulted in the DNSH criteria under point (f) no longer being fulfilled for these activities.",
