      "question": "Why do the verification methodologies under ISO 14044 and ISO 14040 prevent selected e-trucks from achieving taxonomy-alignment, and how does this reflect the EU Taxonomy's emphasis on rigorous environmental standards?",
      "answer": "They were assessed as taxonomy-eligible because they met certain criteria but not taxonomy-aligned due to their life-cycle GHG emissions reduction calculations being verified under ISO 14044 and ISO 14040, which do not fulfill the substantial contribution criteria required by ISO 14067.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006425:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0010",
