      "question": "Why were the geographical positions and production processes of the companies examined for potential negative effects on water quality and scarcity, and how does this align with EU Taxonomy requirements for environmental risk assessments?",
      "answer": "The geographical positions of the locations and the specific production processes were examined to identify potential negative effects on water quality and scarcity. No significant risks were identified during this assessment.",
