      "question": "Why did the European Commission revise the DNSH criterion in July 2023, and how might these changes affect the assessment of substances of very high concern (SVHC) under the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "The European Commission revised the DNSH criterion of the EU Taxonomy in July 2023, creating room for interpretation regarding its impact on internal processes for assessing substitution options for substances of very high concern (SVHC) during the 2023 reporting year.",
