      "question": "How do amendments to disclosure requirements under the Action Plan on Financing Sustainable Growth support the implementation of the EU Taxonomy, and why is transparency critical for achieving sustainability goals?",
      "answer": "Amendments to disclosure requirements are part of the regulatory measures introduced to enhance transparency and ensure that financial activities align with the sustainability goals defined in the Action Plan.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
