      "question": "How does the Annex in the taxonomy framework support the classification and alignment of economic activities with environmental objectives, and why is this structure critical for compliance and reporting?",
      "answer": "The Annex provides the section numbers and details covering the objectives to which economic activities are eligible to contribute, serving as a reference for classification and alignment.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006227:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0010",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
