      "question": "Why does the EU taxonomy implement reduced reporting obligations for newly added activities in the 2023 financial year, and how does this support phased compliance with environmental objectives?",
      "answer": "The reduced reporting obligation for certain activities in the 2023 financial year allows for a focus on taxonomy eligibility rather than full compliance, particularly for activities newly added to the EU taxonomy through recent Delegated Directives.",
