      "question": "Why are the technical screening criteria in Commission Delegated Regulation (EU) 2023/2486 significant for addressing non-climate-related environmental objectives within the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "The technical screening criteria in Regulation (EU) 2023/2486 aim to address the four non-climate-related environmental objectives of the EU Environmental Taxonomy. These criteria apply to both economic activities already covered and those not previously included in the Taxonomy.",
