      "question": "Why is demonstrating compliance with minimum safeguards critical for Hapag-Lloyd to achieve taxonomy-aligned operating expenses, and what challenges does this pose under the EU Taxonomy framework?",
      "answer": "Hapag-Lloyd faces the challenge of demonstrating compliance with the minimum safeguards required for taxonomy alignment. In 2023, this resulted in EUR 0.0 million or 0.0% of Group operating expenses being classified as taxonomy-aligned, highlighting a key area for improvement.",
