      "question": "Why are the economic activities 'manufacture of renewable energy technologies' and 'installation, maintenance, and repair of renewable energy technologies' critical to the SMA Group's taxonomy-aligned operating expenditure, and how do they support EU Taxonomy sustainability goals?",
      "answer": "The taxonomy-aligned operating expenditure includes €24.7 million (36.6%) for manufacturing renewable energy technologies and €1.7 million (2.5%) for installation, maintenance, and repair of renewable energy technologies.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:005927:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0005",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
