      "question": "Why is the use of substances listed under letter f) of the Environmental Act permitted only under controlled conditions, and how does this safeguard EU Taxonomy compliance while addressing environmental and occupational safety concerns?",
      "answer": "The use of substances listed under letter f) is allowed only if there are no alternatives available and they are used under controlled conditions. These conditions ensure that the substances are processed in a way that poses no risk to employees or buyers of the products.",
