      "question": "Why does the inclusion of products not yet covered by the EU Taxonomy Regulation broaden the scope of Net Zero Building contributions, and how does this reflect evolving sustainability standards?",
      "answer": "Products not yet covered by the Taxonomy Regulation are still considered if they contribute to lower energy consumption within buildings. This inclusion broadens the scope of products that can support Net Zero Building goals, even if they do not meet existing regulatory criteria.",
