      "question": "Why has the EU taxonomy scheduled the assessment of suitability for environmental goals such as water protection and ecosystem preservation for 2024, and what challenges might companies face in preparing for this phase?",
      "answer": "The assessment of taxonomy suitability for certain environmental goals, such as sustainable use of water and protection of ecosystems, is delayed until 2024 because the EU taxonomy regulations have scheduled this evaluation for a later phase.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:006263:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0013",
