      "question": "Why does the expanded delegated act on Article 8 of the EU Taxonomy Regulation introduce simplifications for reporting in the 2023 fiscal year, and how does this support entities in transitioning to full compliance?",
      "answer": "For the 2023 fiscal year, the expanded delegated act requires reporting on taxonomy eligibility for environmental objectives 3-6 and additional economic activities under the Climate Law Act. A simplification option allows entities to report only these aspects during the first reporting period.",
