      "question": "Why does the Volkswagen Group tailor allocation methods to different business areas, and how does this differentiation ensure compliance with the EU Taxonomy's principles of accuracy and relevance in reporting?",
      "answer": "The Volkswagen Group uses different allocation methods to ensure accuracy and relevance. In vehicle-related business, planned vehicle volumes guide allocation, while in the Power Engineering Business Area, planned sales revenue is used. This differentiation reflects the unique characteristics of each business area.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "EU Taxonomy",
      "question_id": "train:005936:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0007",
      "difficulty_question_word": "why",
