      "question": "Why does the activity 'Acquisition and ownership of buildings' play a significant role in the MLP Group's Taxonomy-eligible capital expenditures for 2023, and how does it align with EU Taxonomy criteria?",
      "answer": "The activity 'Acquisition and ownership of buildings' (activity 7.7.) represents the majority (42%) of Taxonomy-eligible capital expenditures in 2023, amounting to €13,591 thsd. This highlights its significant contribution to the overall eligible expenditures.",
