      "question": "Why is POLYTEC's adherence to the supplementary delegated legal statutes of the EU Taxonomy Regulation critical for ensuring compliance with sustainability criteria like Minimum Social Safeguards and Do-No-Significant-Harm?",
      "answer": "POLYTEC's reporting aligns with the supplementary delegated legal statutes by providing detailed disclosures on taxonomy-eligible and taxonomy-aligned financial metrics, as well as addressing criteria like Minimum Social Safeguards and Do-No-Significant-Harm.",
