      "question": "Why do staggered technical regulations under the EU Taxonomy pose challenges for primary aluminium production compliance, and what implications does this have for classification as a taxonomy-compliant activity?",
      "answer": "Primary aluminium production compliance is subject to strict technical regulations, which are staggered from 2022 to 2025 or from 2026. Failure to meet these regulations could result in classification as a nontaxonomy-compliant activity.",
