      "question": "Why is it important for ATOSS Software AG to report its revenue, Capex, and Opex in alignment with Article 8 of the EU Taxonomy Regulation, and how does this support the six environmental goals?",
      "answer": "ATOSS Software AG reports the proportion of its Group revenue, capital expenditure (Capex), and operating expenses (Opex) that are eligible or compliant with Article 8 of the EU Taxonomy Regulation. This reporting is aligned with six environmental goals for the 2023 reporting period.",
