      "question": "Why is it beneficial for non-financial undertakings to voluntarily provide additional details in columns (5) to (17) of Section A.2, and how does this support transparency within the EU Taxonomy reporting framework?",
      "answer": "Non-financial undertakings may voluntarily fill columns (5) to (17) in Section A.2 to provide additional details about activities not aligning with any environmental objective, enhancing transparency and reporting depth.",
