      "question": "Why were no additional 'Do No Significant Harm' criteria required for economic activities 7.4 and 7.6 under Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2139, and how does this reflect the regulation's scope and specificity?",
      "answer": "Delegated Regulation (EU) 2021/2139 specifies the requirements for 'Do No Significant Harm' criteria. In this context, it was noted that no additional criteria were required for economic activities 7.4 and 7.6 due to the absence of corresponding requirements in the regulation.",
