      "question": "Why does the late publication of the Draft Commission Notice create challenges for the bank's compliance with EU Taxonomy reporting requirements, and what steps might be necessary to address these challenges in 2024?",
      "answer": "The late publication of the Draft Commission Notice has delayed the determination of a final implementation procedure, meaning the bank has not fully incorporated its content into the current reporting. This will require further evaluation in 2024.",
