      "question": "Why was Hapag-Lloyd's business structure reorganized into Liner Shipping and Terminal & Infrastructure segments following the acquisition of SAAM Terminals, and how does this restructuring align with EU Taxonomy objectives?",
      "answer": "Following the acquisition of SAAM Terminals on August 1, 2023, Hapag-Lloyd's business activities were divided into two segments: Liner Shipping and Terminal & Infrastructure. This restructuring reflects the separation of its core shipping operations and terminal-related activities.",
