      "question": "Why do new construction activities, combined heat and power generation with bioenergy, and the vehicle fleet fail to meet taxonomy alignment criteria despite contributing to environmental objective 1 'Climate change mitigation'?",
      "answer": "New construction activities, combined heat and power generation with bioenergy, and the vehicle fleet are taxonomy-eligible but do not fulfill the criteria for taxonomy alignment, as specified in the context.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
