      "question": "Why is the contractual scope of supply for ANDRITZ Hydro's hydropower solutions categorized under economic activity 3.1 in the EU Taxonomy, and how does this classification impact compliance with IFRS 15?",
      "answer": "The contractual scope of supply typically includes planning, engineering, delivery, installation, and commissioning of equipment. These activities are grouped as an integrated performance obligation under IFRS 15 and categorized under economic activity 3.1 in the EU Taxonomy.",
