      "question": "What are the primary manufacturing processes at ANDRITZ that contribute to resource efficiency and environmental sustainability?",
      "answer": "forming and casting, gluing, hardening and annealing processes, machining, pressing, rolling, soldering, weaving, welding",
      "type": "Factoid",
