      "question": "Which industries served by AMAG benefit from its focus on recycling-compatible alloys and closed-loop recycling?",
      "answer": "automotive sectors, construction, electronics, mechanical engineering, metals trading, packaging industry, renewable energy generation, sporting goods, transport industry",
      "type": "Factoid",
