      "question": "Which functional areas contribute to the organization's sustainable talent development initiatives?",
      "answer": "Commercial, Data & Digital, Finance, Human Resources, In-house Consulting, Manufacturing, Marketing, Operations & Supply Chain, Procurement, Research and Development, Strategy",
