      "question": "Which innovation areas of the Lenzing Group contribute to advancing sustainable practices?",
      "answer": "forward-looking solutions, future-proof business models, net-benefit products, substantial efficiency improvements, systemic change, technological breakthroughs",
      "type": "Factoid",
