      "question": "What initiatives demonstrate Lenzing's leadership in advancing circular economy practices within the textile industry?",
      "answer": "ACTR, Alliance of Chemical Textiles Recyclers, CISUTAC, Christian Doppler Laboratory, Circular and Sustainable Textile Clothing project, Targets for textile recycling, recycling-based circular economy",
      "type": "Factoid",
