      "question": "Which STEM competitions and events in Germany contribute to fostering sustainable scientific education?",
      "answer": "Chemie, die stimmt, Erfinderlabor, Hesse/Thuringia state seminar, Jugend forscht, STEM competitions, Tag der Mathematik, international biology and chemistry Olympiads",
