      "question": "Which chemicals are critical to the Lenzing Group's operations and sustainability efforts?",
      "answer": "N-methylmorpholine N-oxide (NMMO), carbon disulfide (CS<sub>2</sub>), caustic soda (NaOH), flame retardants, modifiers, softening agents, sulfur (S), sulfur dioxide (SO<sub>2</sub>), titanium dioxide (TiO<sub>2</sub>), zinc sulfate (ZnSO<sub>4</sub>)",
