      "question": "How does the Ford-Volkswagen alliance contribute to sustainable mobility through vehicle projects?",
      "answer": "Ford Ranger, Ford Tourneo Connect, New Transporter, Volkswagen Amarok, Volkswagen Caddy, city van, mid-size pickup, one-tonne cargo van, three vehicle projects",
