      "question": "What sustainability-focused initiatives are part of WACKER's environmental protection investments?",
      "answer": "climate change mitigation, emissions control, noise reduction, preservation of the natural landscape, soil remediation, waste management, water-pollution control",
      "type": "Factoid",
