      "question": "What initiatives does UNIQA Austria implement to promote equitable healthcare and sustainable well-being?",
      "answer": "contemporary medical care, equal access to care services, medical centres, partner network LARA, reduces social inequalities in healthcare, telemedicine surgeries, trained Vital-Coaches",
