      "question": "Which innovative solutions is Evonik developing to support sustainable industries and healthcare advancements?",
      "answer": "cancer immunotherapies, extract hydrogen, infectious disease control, lipids for modern therapies, membranes to treat biogas, outstanding products and technologies, specialty solutions for battery technologies",
