      "answer": "100 neighborhood charging stations, bicycle parking spaces, bicycle-related mobility solutions, bike sharing services, cargo bikes, charging facilities for electric mobility, charging infrastructure for electric vehicles, cycling-related services, e-bikes, municipal cycle path networks, repair stations",
