        "paragraph": "In the years ahead, indirect emissions along the value chain (Scope 3) in particular will be crucial to reducing the Company's overall emissions. This also includes CO<sub>2</sub> emissions caused by purchased equipment, business travel and emplouee commuting.\nThe SYZYGY GROUP's supply chain accounts for 79 per cent (previous year: 84 per cent) of total Scope 3 emissions, at 598 tonnes of  $CO<sub>2</sub>$  emissions (per employee: 0.97 t  $CO<sub>2</sub>$ ). This corresponds to a reduction of 29 per cent. The goal is to reduce these emissions through measures and initiatives relating to employee commuting and working from home, the usage of electronic devices and business travel.\nData collection for Scope 3 emissions is especially difficult as they are beyond the SYZYGY GROUP's direct control. Despite this, the Group is actively committed to improving data collection and aualitu.",
