      "question": "Which tools and systems are being implemented at Hapag-Lloyd to support sustainable collaboration and modern office practices?",
      "answer": "advanced software and hardware, collaboration systems, modern office concepts, open office concepts, ultra-modern, sustainable working environments, video conference equipment",
