      "question": "Which vehicle brands are assessed for sustainability-related warranty and repair cost efficiency?",
      "answer": "Audi, Porsche, SEAT/CUPRA, Volkswagen Commercial Vehicles, Volkswagen Passenger Cars, Škoda",
