      "question": "Which types of buildings in the property portfolio contribute to resource efficiency and sustainability efforts?",
      "answer": "1 hotel, 2 buildings with gas, 5 buildings were heated with district heat, 5 multi-tenant office buildings, 6 developed buildings, buildings for interim use, temporary buildings",
