      "question": "Which Lenzing sites are involved in sustainability initiatives related to wastewater treatment or pollution reduction?",
      "answer": "Grimsby (United Kingdom), Heiligenkreuz (Austria), Indianópolis (Brazil), Lenzing (Austria), Paskov (Czech Republic), Prachinburi (Thailand), Purwakarta (Indonesia)",
