      "question": "Which factors contribute to sustainable and vibrant neighborhoods by addressing social and ecological needs?",
      "answer": "availability of local suppliers, communal spaces, good educational facilities, integration of small businesses, modern transport connections, social and cultural facilities",
      "type": "Factoid",
