      "question": "What types of emission sources are tracked by STRATEC to manage its environmental impact?",
      "answer": "building heating, employees' journeys to and from work, gas, heating oil, purchased goods, upstream energy chain, upstream logistics, vehicle pool, waste disposal, work-related flights",
      "type": "Factoid",
