      "question": "What components are essential for planning EV charging infrastructure in sustainable urban developments?",
      "answer": "EV charging stations, cable conduits, charging connection, charging stations for electric vehicles, later retrofitting efforts, parking spaces with electric charging points, sufficient number of charging stations, suitable charging capacity",
