      "question": "Which renewable energy technologies are eligible for inclusion in sustainable insurance policies for businesses?",
      "answer": "biogas, fuel cells, heat pumps, hydroelectric power, insurance cover for solar and photovoltaic systems, wind energy",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:002294:qa_pairs_factoid:0003",
