      "question": "Which measures were implemented to enhance energy efficiency and support renewable energy use in buildings?",
      "answer": "climate neutrality, climate-damaging emissions, electricity from renewable sources, energy efficiency, energy from renewable sources, green electricity strategy, photovoltaic systems, photovoltaics initiative, power purchase agreement, total capacity of approximately 3,400 KWp",
      "type": "Factoid",
