      "question": "What sustainability-focused measures were implemented in Poland's new-build projects to enhance biodiversity and green infrastructure?",
      "answer": "25,000 sqm of green roofs, 6,500 sqm of rain gardens, 86,000 sqm of green spaces, more than 800 trees, rainwater irrigation system, shrubs and flower meadows",
      "type": "Factoid",
