      "question": "Which processes at the Ranshofen site contribute to sustainable recycling and scrap management?",
      "answer": "accurate separation, differentiated storage, incoming scrap shipments, output maximisation, radioactivity testing, recycling processes, scrap sampling, separation and sorting",
      "type": "Factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:002326:qa_pairs_factoid:0001",
