      "question": "Which measures were introduced to enhance communication and streamline processes for sustainable customer service delivery?",
      "answer": "Ongoing improvement of internal processes, Optimisation of our regular communication formats, lively interactions across all regions, possible solutions, regular communication on weak points, respond to customer enquiries more quickly",
