      "question": "Which efficiency and optimization strategies are being prioritized by the Volkswagen Group to achieve sustainability goals?",
      "answer": "considerable savings potential, drive system efficiency, enhancing synergies, optimized aerodynamics, reduce variance, reduced rolling resistance",
      "type": "Factoid",
