      "question": "What macroeconomic factors linked to sustainability risks are impacting AMAG Group's operations globally?",
      "answer": "geopolitical conflicts, global economic growth, international trade restrictions, introduction of tariffs, macroeconomic risks, political situation in individual sales regions",
      "type": "Factoid",
