      "question": "What factors influenced AGRANA's market and business environment changes in Ukraine and Russia during the conflict?",
      "answer": "increased demand from Ukrainian dairy manufacturers, loss of export markets, lower domestic consumption, resumption of the food service business, significant shifts in the market environment",
      "type": "Factoid",
