      "question": "What techniques are implemented to minimize emissions in alignment with sustainability goals for production facilities?",
      "answer": "adsorption, catalysts, catalytic incineration, condensation, desulfurization, dry scrubbing, electric filters, remove particulates, returning exhaust gases to the production process, thermal processing of residual gases, washing with subsequent precipitation",
      "type": "Factoid",
