          "$CO4$ Corporate structure Performance Technology & **Specialty Additives Divisions Nutrition & Care Smart Materials Evonik Group<sup>a</sup> Materials** Infrastructure **Sales** 3,520 3,611 4,461 2,549 1,073 15,267  $(in \\in$  million) **Employees** 3,492 5,630 8,103 1,738 8,197 33,409"
