      "question": "Which key elements of the decarbonisation strategy contribute to achieving compliance with the 1.5-degree target of the Paris Climate Agreement?",
      "answer": "decarbonisation strategy, efficient system controls, extensive data collection and analysis, heating systems, modernising the building substance, renewable fuels, specific concepts, measures, and a timeline",
      "type": "Factoid",
