      "question": "Why is it important for the company to standardize energy consumption metrics across Germany, Austria, and Sweden, and how does this approach support its sustainability objectives and regulatory compliance?",
      "answer": "The company aims to use comparable metrics for energy consumption because efficiency classes are defined differently in Germany, Austria, and Sweden. This approach addresses the challenge of standardizing energy efficiency targets across diverse national contexts.",
