      "question": "Why are the 'Principles and Guidelines for the Protection of the Environment' and 'Principles and Guidelines for Ecologically and Socially Responsible Procurement' critical for embedding sustainability across the Group?",
      "answer": "These principles and guidelines aim to consolidate and clarify the company's previous regulations on environmental protection and responsible procurement. They ensure consistent application of sustainability standards across the Group and provide a framework for environmentally and socially responsible practices.",
