      "question": "Why is the reduction in CO2 emissions per economic output significant for SGL Carbon's sustainability performance, and how does it reflect progress toward resource efficiency and environmental goals?",
      "answer": "SGL Carbon's CO2 emissions per economic output decreased from 0.29 kt per €1.0 million in sales in 2022 to 0.27 kt per €1.0 million in 2023, reflecting improved efficiency.",
