        "paragraph": "The goal of the Zumtobel Group is to generate high added value and provide an attractive service offering for customers with a minimum of materials from primary resources. New possibilities are under development to extend the product lifecycle and to use products and materials in a circular flow through a network of collaboration partners:\n- $\\rightarrow$ Maintenance & upgrade\n- $\\rightarrow$ Maintenance & upgrade\n- $\\rightarrow$ Reuse & remanufacturing\n- $\\rightarrow$ High-value recycling",
