      "question": "Why did differing interpretations of emission factors by the European Commission and member states create uncertainty in the ethanol market, and what does this reveal about sustainability governance in the EU?",
      "answer": "The discussions created uncertainty because differing interpretations of emission factors could alter the greenhouse gas savings attributed to ethanol, impacting its market valuation and sustainability profile.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
      "tag": "Sustainability",
      "question_id": "train:001742:qa_pairs_non_factoid:0014",
