      "answer": "The Adriatic and Romania regions are focal points for IMMOFINANZ Group's development projects because they collectively represent the majority of the expected fair value upon completion, amounting to EUR 82.8 million and EUR 39.8 million, respectively, out of a total of EUR 122.6 million.",
