      "question": "Why did high temperatures and lower water consumption during the summer of 2023 necessitate adaptive drinking water management strategies at the Ranshofen site, and how were these strategies aligned with sustainability principles?",
      "answer": "High temperatures and lower water consumption during the summer of 2023 posed challenges for drinking water management. These conditions required the draining of some water from the AMAG water tower, which was subsequently reused as service water to minimise waste.",
