      "question": "Why are materiality considerations essential in determining the inclusion of subsidiaries like scanplus GmbH in sustainability reporting, and how do they align with environmental accountability principles?",
      "answer": "Materiality considerations influence the inclusion of a subsidiary in sustainability reporting to ensure that only significant and impactful entities are included, avoiding the distortion of data by entities with minimal contributions, such as scanplus GmbH, which was acquired late in the year.",
