      "question": "Why is collaboration with the Science Based Target Initiative critical for ensuring TeamViewer's greenhouse gas reduction targets align with global climate goals, and what validation processes are involved?",
      "answer": "TeamViewer works with the Science Based Target Initiative (SBTi) to set its targets, which are based on long-term temperature trajectories of well below 2°C and 1.5°C. The SBTi validation team has reviewed and confirmed the alignment of TeamViewer's Scope 1 and 2 targets with these goals.",
