      "question": "Why does wienerberger report coal, fuel oil, and LNG consumption as an aggregate figure, and how does this approach align with its sustainability strategy to reduce reliance on high-emission energy sources?",
      "answer": "Coal, fuel oil, and LNG consumption is reported as an aggregate figure because these high-emission energy sources meet only a small part of wienerberger's total energy demand. This approach reflects their reduced significance in the company's overall energy profile.",
