      "question": "Why is the purchase of renewable electricity considered the most impactful lever in Siltronic's climate strategy, and how does it reflect the company's commitment to sustainability and decarbonization?",
      "answer": "The purchase of renewable electricity is the most significant lever because it is expected to contribute around 95% of the necessary CO2 emission reductions by 2030, highlighting its central role in achieving Siltronic's climate targets.",
