      "question": "Why is the 'waste' category not currently accounted for in Scope 3 emissions, and how does the company’s IT hardware refurbishment initiative reflect sustainability priorities despite this omission?",
      "answer": "Although the company does not currently account for the 'waste' category in Scope 3 emissions, their efforts in refurbishing IT hardware still resulted in significant CO<sub>2</sub> equivalent savings, demonstrating a commitment to sustainability.",
      "type": "Descriptive, non-factoid",
