      "question": "Why was the Sustainability Council established to replace the Sustainability Steering Committee, and how does this change strengthen the KION Group's ability to address evolving sustainability regulations and practices?",
      "answer": "The Sustainability Council was established to ensure the sustainability program is uniformly applied, continually enhanced, and implemented across the KION Group. It also addresses regulatory requirements, such as those from the German Commercial Code and EU legislation.",
