      "question": "Why is it significant for 1&1 to maintain separate email channels for investor relations and sustainability, and how does this approach align with governance best practices in sustainability communication?",
      "answer": "The email 'ir@1und1.de' likely serves general inquiries, complementing 'sustainability@1und1.de' by ensuring that sustainability-related matters are handled separately, reflecting a structured approach to communication and prioritization of sustainability within the company.",
