      "question": "Why are the activities organized under the SOS Children's Villages program in Ukraine pivotal for advancing sustainable child protection systems, and how do they address the specific needs of families and children?",
      "answer": "The program has launched public mobilization campaigns, provided education for caregivers, and developed local social plans based on families' and children's needs. These activities aim to drive systemic changes in child protection and promote family-based care.",
