      "question": "How has TAKKT utilized the GHG Protocol Corporate Accounting and Reporting Standard to measure and improve its greenhouse gas emissions accounting, and why is this critical for its sustainability strategy?",
      "answer": "In 2021, TAKKT began accounting for all emissions produced by its companies using the GHG Protocol Corporate Accounting and Reporting Standard. By 2023, it improved data quality and conducted a thorough review across its 59 locations.",
