      "question": "Why does the company prioritize addressing environmental and social challenges, such as climate change and cybercrime, in its software-based solutions, and how does this align with sustainability goals?",
      "answer": "The company takes into account current environmental and social challenges, such as climate change and cybercrime, when developing software-based solutions. This ensures that their innovations are both effective and sustainable.",
